#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/capabilities.md:1
msgid "派生能力与接入矩阵"
msgstr "Derived capabilities and integration matrix"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/capabilities.md:3
msgid ""
"本表由 `tools/maintenance/capabilities.py` 读取维护中的 `soc.json`、 `routes.json`、参考 Board "
"`board.json`，并运行现有软件 assembly 的生产 resolver 和 binding emitter 生成。表格不是另一份配置输入；修改能力从原始事实、实现和 "
"回归开始，随后执行 `--write` 更新本派生文本，`--check` 拒绝任何过时内容。"
msgstr ""
"`tools/maintenance/capabilities.py` derives this table by reading maintained `soc.json`, "
"`routes.json` and reference-Board `board.json`, then running the production resolver/binding "
"emitter on software assemblies. The table is not another configuration input. Capability changes "
"start with original facts, implementation and regressions, then `--write` refreshes derived prose "
"and `--check` rejects stale content."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/capabilities.md:8
msgid "**Mode** 是 SoC 声明的有限模式；无 route 的模式不能据此选择连接。"
msgstr ""
"**Mode** is a bounded SoC-declared mode; a mode without routes does not authorize connections."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/capabilities.md:9
msgid "**Reviewed SoC routes** 描述已维护的芯片路线，不是 PCB 连续性或电气资格。"
msgstr ""
"**Reviewed SoC routes** describe maintained chip routes, not PCB continuity/electrical "
"qualification."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/capabilities.md:10
msgid "**Declared reference Boards** 表示 Board 中存在对应 binding，不表示默认 assembly 已启用它，也不表示实板验收通过。"
msgstr ""
"**Declared reference Boards** means the Board has a binding, not that the default assembly enables"
" it or physical acceptance passed."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/capabilities.md:12
msgid "**Resolver fixtures** 是当前实际通过解析的 TOML 软件夹具。"
msgstr "**Resolver fixtures** are TOML software fixtures actually accepted by the current resolver."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/capabilities.md:13
msgid ""
"**Selected production source** 从实际生成的 face 读取完整 ops 标识，匹配生产 C 中已初始化的导出定义；注释、字符串、声明和相似前缀不算定义。这是有限源码"
" 一致性证据，不替代编译、执行或物理测量。空白列明确没有该类证据。"
msgstr ""
"**Selected production source** reads full ops identifiers from actual generated faces and matches "
"initialized exported definitions in production C; comments, strings, declarations and similar "
"prefixes are not definitions. This is bounded source-consistency evidence, not "
"compilation/execution/physical measurement. Blank columns explicitly lack such evidence."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/capabilities.md:17
msgid ""
"表格不从旧候选继承新 HEAD 的软件资格，也不推断物理结果。三板实物未连接，HIL 保持 `not_executed`。精确模式限制及所有权合同见[支持范围](support.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The table inherits no old-candidate qualification for new HEAD and infers no physical results. The"
" three actual Boards are disconnected; HIL remains `not_executed`. Exact mode limits/ownership are"
" in [support scope](support.md)."

